WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.160
Research Assistant Wanted
招聘研究助理

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:16.180
Prof. Smith from the School of Physical Education is looking for a student assistant for a research project on campus sports activities, which will run from March to June.
体育学院的史密斯教授正在为一项关于校园体育活动的研究项目寻找一名学生助理，该项目将从3月持续到6月。

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:26.580
The assistant will be responsible for distributing and collecting questionnaires, interviewing students about their exercise habits and organizing the data collected.
助理将负责发放和回收问卷、就学生的锻炼习惯对他们进行采访，以及整理收集到的数据。

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:32.170
The job requires about eight hours a week, and a monthly allowance will be provided.
这份工作每周大约需要八个小时，并且每月会发放津贴。

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:36.730
Applicants should be full-time students with a keen interest in sports.
应聘者应为对体育运动有浓厚兴趣的全日制学生。

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:43.000
Good communication skills and a basic knowledge of statistical software are also required.
良好的沟通能力和统计软件的基础知识也是必备条件。

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:52.960
Those interested are welcome to send a brief CV to Prof. Smith’s office, Room 305, Sports Building, before March 1.
有意者欢迎于3月1日前将一份简短的简历送至体育楼305室史密斯教授的办公室。

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:54.480
Li Ming
李明
